Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.61,0:00:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.71,0:00:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.53,0:00:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.01,0:00:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.51,0:01:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary until\Nsomeone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.23,0:01:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble and times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.57,0:01:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\NAll your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\NThat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.17,0:01:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.15,0:01:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.39,0:01:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.07,0:01:54.91,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(727,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(686,727,\1a&H00&)}For Whom the Bell Tolls
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.07,0:01:54.91,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(727,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}For Whom the Bell Tolls
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, he just...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.41,0:01:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just broke Captain Kudo's cat claw.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.07,0:02:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That leaves only five more\Nof those weird swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.83,0:02:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can still fight plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.33,0:02:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he still has another\Nclaw. You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.31,0:02:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rip that Katorea shrimp, Captain Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.81,0:02:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't use that name anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.55,0:02:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't like it, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think in this village his\Nname is Kla-ha... something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.41,0:02:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kla-ha something! Yeah! Kla-ha\Nsomething! Get him! Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.11,0:02:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouths!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.39,0:02:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out, you brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.39,0:02:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.17,0:02:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give yourselves up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.83,0:02:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come over here and we'll take you to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.35,0:02:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.57,0:02:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.59,0:02:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't fall for that, you silly rugrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.09,0:03:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got him! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepper attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.41,0:03:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of the line, hypnotist!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you bit off a little\Nmore than you could chew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.31,0:03:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.37,0:03:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real pirates don't take kindly to\Nbeing mocked by the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Onion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pretend, pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.91,0:04:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure got in over your heads, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rich girl, I know you're here. Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.93,0:04:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you show yourself, I'll\Nexecute these three little lambs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I will make sure to do\Nit in a most painful fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.61,0:04:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not doubt my skill at such a task.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.77,0:04:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.29,0:04:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kaya, run for your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.

